<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the $926,250 women's German Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>7-Amanda Coetzer (South Africa) beat 1-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>6-0 6-1</p>
<p>2-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium)</p>
<p>1-6 6-2 6-0</p>
<p>10-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Anna Kurnikova (Russia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>12-Mary Pierce (France) beat 6-Iva Majoli (Croatia) 6-1 6-4</p>
</text>
